{"key":"076fee6da156b34c","source_file":"Potts Mi - My.json","source_id":56819,"source_url":"concordance-mutter-ppl-mussitare","term":"Mutter","headwords":["Mutter","Muttering"],"latin":["Mussitare","Mussitatio"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Mutter"],"latin":["Mussitare"]},{"english":["Muttering"],"latin":["Mussitatio"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AR","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"4657","subsection":null},"text":"Spirits have spoken with me, by muttering... (which) is not becoming in the other life, because it manifests that they have been whisperers. (Continued. See Whisper.) SE 1149.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"449","subsection":"3"},"text":"They muttered more things, which I did not hear.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"462","subsection":"3"},"text":"Under Enchant, see this reference. AR 462:5. AR 655:5. AE 590:2.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"462","subsection":"5"},"text":"Muttering. Illustrated.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"655","subsection":"4"},"text":"Let us send some one skilled in muttering, who can make black white...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"72","subsection":"2"},"text":"(These simple and upright Spirits) stood amazed, muttering together...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"6110","subsection":"35"},"text":"So that he dare not mutter against her will.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"mutter-076fee","url":"/meta/potts/mutter-076fee/"}